## Why This Is Asked

Evaluates expertise in designing secure update systems for distributed edge infrastructure with unreliable connectivity, requiring comprehensive threat modeling around supply chain security, key management, and operational resilience.

## Key Concepts

- Device attestation and secure boot verification
- The Update Framework (TUF) and cryptographically signed deltas
- Atomic upgrade mechanisms with rollback protection
- Key rotation, revocation, and compromise containment strategies
- Bandwidth-efficient delivery and cryptographic implementations

